WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.380
I have less presence than other people.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:11.790
I realized this when they edited me
into our class yearbook photo,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.170
Junior High Graduation Commemoration Photo

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.960
because they thought I wasn't in it.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:22.210
Haruka North High School

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:27.420
Everyone wants to live life to
the fullest during their adolescence.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.500
But there's no way I'll be able to.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:37.040
Shiraishi, are you here?

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.790
I guess not.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:44.250
I'll put the handout on his desk.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.040
Sensei.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.460
I'm right here.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.080
Thank you for the handout.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.420
Shiraishi, where were you?

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.880
I was behind you.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.830
Comprehensive

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.830
History

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:03.880
I'm invisible like air, so it's difficult to get
other people to acknowledge my existence.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.960
Yeah, the opening talk was really-

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.790
Shiraishi's here!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.250
Huh, where?

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:11.420
Quintuple take.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.290
I was so shook.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:14.880
Woah, that's awesome!

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:15.670
Huh? He's gone?!

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:16.750
But he was just here, I'm serious!

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.880
Even though I'm right there, I'm not noticed.
That's my life for you.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:27.670
I can't even get on stage, let alone perform as
the main character of my teenage years.

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:30.830
Background character

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.580
That being said...

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.250
Good morning, Shiraishi-kun.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.540
Kubo-san is the only one who can spot me.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:21.250
Episode 1: Heroine and Background Character

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:18.170
You looking something up?

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.880
K..Kubo-san...

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:23.670
Uh, um...

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.500
Background character

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.500
How to slack off in class like a background character

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.500
How to become invisible

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.500
How to be noticed when you're a background character

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.380
Lean

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.210
I. Saw. That.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.040
Kubo-san, delete it! Please!

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:40.670
Nope, no way.

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:49.250
Class 1-1. Nagisa Kubo-san.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.420
She's a good student.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.210
And she's athletic.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:59.210
To someone like me, Kubo-san's presence
is worlds apart from my own.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:01.670
Or so I thought.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.420
Hey, Shiraishi-kun.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.960
Just how invisible are you to everyone else?

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:09.130
Huh?

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.170
Like, would nobody notice even
if you stood during class?

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.000
They'd probably notice.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:18.920
Hey-

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:19.750
No way I'm doing that.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.630
Pout all you want, it's not happening.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.880
You won't?

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:37.130
Even though I don't stand out,
people would still notice if I stood up during class.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.960
Shiraishi-kun, is it really a good idea to refuse me?

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.210
How about you give it a go?

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:51.880
Is she a demoness?

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:57.830
You should probably keep this point in mind.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.830
1. Sitting on his knees

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.420
You got away with it.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.460
So that's how invisible I am.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.830
2. Kneeling on his chair

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.380
You can still kick it up a notch.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.830
3. Standing on his chair

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.210
Wow, you stood all the way up! Awesome!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.960
Shiraishi, sit down.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.460
When did the teacher notice?

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:32.420
That was a riot.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.380
It was embarrassing for me.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:35.920
Are you upset?

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.170
No, I'm not.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.000
Really?

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:39.920
Really.

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.420
Then let's do it again!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.250
Crap!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.130
Shiraishi-kun.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:48.830
Today, you were the main character in class!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.670
Then that makes you the conniving villainess.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.000
So you are a little upset.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.380
But still, calling me the villainess is mean.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.500
Let's start over!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.670
Start over?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.080
I'm not your antagonist...

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.790
I'm your heroine!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.830
Go ahead, try saying it.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.170
You're my...

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.290
Not a chance I'm saying that.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.380
What a grouch.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.540
What?

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.290
Nah, it's nothing.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.130
Kubocchi, it's time to go to our next class.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:35.290
I'm coming!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.710
We're leaving you behind.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:37.960
Wait!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.790
What the heck was that about?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.460
Today was an unprecedented day.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.920
I saw Shiraishi twice!

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.830
Maybe something lucky will happen then.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.210
What're you talking about! He's not a four-leaf clover.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:59.330
He's nothing like a four-leaf clover.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:04.460
A mythical being!!!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:04.460
Have you seen him?!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:04.460
Searching for this man      All info is useful

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:06.500
Wasn't there a guy who didn't see Shiraishi
even a single time for over half the school year?

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:04.460
Eyewitness reports wanted!! Out-of-this-world divine favor!!

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:04.460
Whoever finds him will be blessed with GOOD FORTUNE!!

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.000
He's on the same level as cryptids
like tsuchinoko and kappa.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.540
You're so right!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:15.420
I thought he always played hooky in junior high,

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:19.630
so I was surprised when I heard later
that he didn't miss class even once.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:21.290
What, really?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.670
In a way, it's a superpower.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:28.000
Totally. There are probably jobs that can
only be done by someone like Shiraishi.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.750
But I can find him without any difficulty.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:34.130
Shiraishi

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.210
I'm home!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.290
Welcome back!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:55.460
Even if I can't be the main character of my adolescence,
each person has their own reason for living.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.210
I've read my favorite manga over and over.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.080
Surprisingly, a life like that isn't bad.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.790
Rumble,

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.790
rumble...

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:21.500
Hmph!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.210
Um...

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:24.920
Are you mad?

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.380
Sulk

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.540
Did I do something?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:29.830
Pout!

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.330
You've got no clue?

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.920
I honestly don't have the faintest idea.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.080
Have this.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.670
Hometown

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.670
Milk

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.830
Calcium is good for anger.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.250
What's that for?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.380
I'm sorry.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:44.830
This morning.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:53.830
Hometown

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:53.830
Milk

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.580
This morning?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.170
Yep. Really try to remember.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.880
Um, if I remember correctly, this morning...

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.580
Banana

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.580
au Lait

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:56.710
Strawberry

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:56.710
au Lait

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.580
Today, I'm buying lunch at the convenience
store instead of the school cafeteria.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:56.710
Banana

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:56.710
au Lait

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.710
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.210
Coming, sir.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.710
Sir?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:08.000
Hometown

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:08.000
Milk

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:08.000
Anpan

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.250
Guess he's one of those jerks who expects
you to put things back on the shelf for them.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.040
I'm here.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.290
I'm so sorry, sir! So sorry!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.330
It's all right. I'm used to it.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.710
After I bought lunch, I headed back to school.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:20.710
...is what I thought.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:21.580
Really?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.170
Good morning!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.250
Kubocchi, Hazuki, good morning!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:34.130
Good morning. You're late, Tama.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:35.790
C'mon, let's go.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.710
Then I went into the classroom.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.790
And that brings us to now.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.830
C'mon, Shiraishi-kun.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.540
How haven't you figured it out?

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.380
She drank it after all.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.960
Now I have to punish you.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.000
That's over the top.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:03.080
You told me you get sat on by other people while
you're sitting sometimes because they don't notice you.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:08.170
Well, if the person sitting on you is quiet,
maybe no one would be any the wiser.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.170
No way, they'd definitely notice.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:12.670
You wouldn't dare.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:15.830
I do dare!

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:29.040
Just like I thought, nobody noticed.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.670
That's not the issue here!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.790
But I wonder what would happen if you made noise.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.330
It wouldn't do to be noticed now.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.580
You gotta be like air right now.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.750
She's soft.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.250
And she smells good.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.960
She's really soft.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.580
That's probably what other people would think.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.330
But I'm a teenage loser.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.000
Shiraishi-kun?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.790
My brain completely short-circuited.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:08.210
You're super funny!

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:09.670
Ow.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:10.920
Oh, yeah.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.540
When someone says hello to you, you say hi back.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.040
Where the heck did that come from all of a sudden?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.380
Understood?

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:19.880
Yes, understood.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.880
All right! I forgive you for this morning.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.500
So why were you mad at me anyway?

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.830
Well, that's...

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.170
My secret.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.170
Oh, he

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.170
ran away.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.830
Did I take it a little too far?

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:51.250
She's definitely toying with me.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.040
Why's she using me for her games?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.790
Why do you think?

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.250
You're killing time?

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:04.250
I'm like a pet or toy to you.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.380
I gotcha.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:08.710
So why?

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:11.000
Hmm, why indeed?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:16.250
It's no fun if I just tell you.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.500
What the heck is her deal?

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.000
You didn't

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.000
finish…

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.000
You're

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.000
welcome

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.000
to it.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.000
Milk

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:33.040
Oh, I see, I see! Yes, yes.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.540
Thank you.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:49.750
Shiraishi-kun, you always ask
the teacher questions after class.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:55.880
Oh. That's just me making sure
the teacher knows I actually attended.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.170
But you were here the whole time!

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:05.040
I was, but I have to yell during roll call to be noticed.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:06.920
I'm present!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.960
I don't want everyone thinking,
"What's that weirdo's problem?"

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:12.290
That sucks.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.290
Guess that's just my lot in life.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.420
I gotcha. By the way...

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.790
Have you ever been called on during class?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:20.500
Nope.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.420
That's awesome.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:24.290
I guess there are some perks.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:29.170
Shiraishi-kun, whaddaya think of trying
to answer a question in class?

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:35.000
I don't wanna. It'd be a bother.
And I bet it'd be nerve-racking.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.920
Hmm, I gotcha.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:45.290
Now then, does anyone know
the answer to this question?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.420
I do, Sensei!

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:49.420
Great, go ahead Kubo.

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:51.790
I don't know.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:56.960
But I think Shiraishi-kun knows the answer.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.000
Oh, Shiraishi's here?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.790
Then could you answer instead of Kubo?

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:09.540
You're so off base, Kubo-san.
This isn't the time for a thumbs-up.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.170
I didn't ask you to do this. You really put me in a fix.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:18.210
chatter

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:18.210
chatter

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.830
Shiraishi-kun came to class.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.380
I wonder if Shiraishi-kun is smart?

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.210
He must be smart since Kubo-san
thinks he knows the answer.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:16.790
I spotted Shiraishi!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.210
Today's my lucky day, so I'll roll gacha!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:19.330
Kubo-san.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.460
But I don't know the answer.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:25.670
That's okay.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.670
I'm not okay.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.210
Shiraishi-kun.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.580
Name: Nagisa Kubo

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.580
What is the general term for the hominins that are believed to have

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.580
lived in South and East Africa between 4.2 million and 2 million years ago?

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.580
Australopithecus

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.580
When I said I didn't know the answer, I was lying.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.920
It's Australopithecus.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:48.580
Correct! You may sit down.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:52.670
My heart was beating so fast I thought I was gonna die.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.500
Even so...

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.790
You seem a little pleased.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:03.880
Hold up. Since you knew the answer,
you should've answered the question yourself.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:08.290
I figured you've never asked
your seat neighbors for an answer before.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:09.500
I haven't, but...

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:14.670
You'll have my back when I don't know the answer, right?

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.460
I'm counting on you.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:26.630
Class rank:

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:26.630
3rd

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:26.630
Class rank:

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:26.630
105th/200

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:20.500
Aren't you smart though?

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.540
But I don't always know the answer.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.830
Like, I don't know the answer to question five.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:28.250
Try answering question five, Kubo.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:29.830
Huh?

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:33.080
It's crazy you got called on twice.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.380
Shiraishi-kun.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.750
Do you remember what I said before?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.830
Comprehensive

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.830
History

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.500
Tell me the answer.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.710
Um, I don't know if this is right, but...

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.830
Thanks for saving my neck!

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:01.210
No problem.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.710
Shiraishi-kun, do you have Pine?

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.830
NacDonalds

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:06.960
Well, yeah.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.580
Really, then we-

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:12.580
Hey, Nagisa, wanna grab some tea and go home?

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.920
Oh, sure!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:17.750
Should I indulge in some sweets today?

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.380
Finally, the long-awaited day is here.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.040
Tomorrow is the game's release date!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:37.040
Nanohana Park

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.710
Hey! It's Shiraishi-kun!

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:47.000
Oh.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.040
It's unusual for us to see each other on a school holiday.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:51.750
Are you on your way home after shopping?

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:54.630
No, um...

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.040
What exactly was I doing today?

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:58.960
Huh?

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:03.380
I went out to buy a game, but I saw
someone handing out packets of tissues.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:07.880
I wanted some, but sure enough, I couldn't get any.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.500
I wondered just how far I'd need to go
to snag a pack, so I tested it, but...

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.000
Shiraishi-kun's gazing far into the distance!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.000
Hello! Yes, here you go!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:25.080
Eventually, I figured out the fastest way to get
a pack was to speak up and ask for one.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:27.290
Way to go.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.000
What game did you buy? One of your favorites?

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:32.330
Well.

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:38.420
I felt so accomplished after getting the tissues,
I forgot the game and went home.

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:40.330
Shiraishi-kun!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.130
Oh yeah!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.040
Shiraishi-kun, look this way.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.710
What?

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:57.380
Huh. For some reason, my phone's camera
doesn't recognize your face.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:02.130
I wonder how close you need
to be for it to detect your face.

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:04.380
I don't think it'll work.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:08.460
Then I vote that it will.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.500
Okay, look at the camera.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.210
Huh, we're taking a selfie?

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.880
You gotta see for yourself if
it recognizes your face or not.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.080
It still hasn't detected your face.

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:23.040
We gotta get closer.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.080
So close.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.130
Maybe a little closer.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:29.670
Ah!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.250
I won!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:39.210
All right, what will I make you do for me?

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:41.130
Huh, I gotta do something?

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:42.080
Duh!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:45.420
Oh, I got it! Give me your Pine contact info.

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:46.170
What?

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.790
I'll send you the selfie we took today.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:53.040
What? Did you expect something else?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.960
Hee-

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.960
hee

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.790
Well, not really.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.130
Hey, Shiraishi-kun.

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.630
We should hang out together sometime.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:03.920
Huh?

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.170
Huh?

