00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.250
Oh, that's what you're getting at.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:19.290
Yep, that's what I meant.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:25.960
Today

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:25.960
Added

