00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.080
This time, I'll have mercy on you.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.080
Kubo-san holding back?

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:39.380
Is the sky gonna fall next?

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:53.130
