00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.250
Nothing!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.920
I exchanged Pine contact info with Kubo-san.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.750
Today

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.750
Kubo-san

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:13.580
